# Diagnostic toolchain: the harnesses are committed, what they run on is not.
# `npm install --prefix tools/diag playwright axe-core sharp` restores them; `npx playwright install webkit chromium`
# fetches the browsers. Evidence and server logs are per-run and never committed.
tools/diag/node_modules
tools/diag/out
tools/diag/*.log

# production artifacts packaged for upload
deploy/
